  <reporting-org ref="GB-CHC-285776" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Management of EVD Response Fleet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to support the consolidation of management of EVD response fleets under a consortium of three non-governmental partner agencies(CRS, CAFOD, &amp; World Vision), for front-line vehicles supporting the response to the Ebola Virus Disease (EVD) outbreak in Sierra Leone. The consolidation of fleet management, including maintenance, fueling, decontamination, tracking, and security, will contribute to reduction in transmission and mortality of EVD by improving the effectiveness of district-level EVD response programs, and the key response sectors of case surveillance and tracking, safe burial, live case management, swab teams, and response coordination. 

For CAFOD, this project is going to be implemented by Caritas Makeni in Kambia district .</narrative>
  </description>
